  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "322期封面作品—繪本 《喀噠喀噠喀噠》 內頁"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhFz4Zxbfre6F_yU049BQVbuay1PRTGCeChCk0tq5wzoe3TGoj1YTV-vgzukLJVhgdum4KAlxxxr54DsdwhHDqEmyH0GKKY89ihZR2J48AWUoFiqW2qU4FpIKM1ja7YtF_q5KLiQWWIka_Q/s1000/%25E5%2596%2580%25E5%2599%25A0%25E5%2596%2580%25E5%2599%25A0%25E5%2596%2580%25E5%2599%25A0.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"628\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"402\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhFz4Zxbfre6F_yU049BQVbuay1PRTGCeChCk0tq5wzoe3TGoj1YTV-vgzukLJVhgdum4KAlxxxr54DsdwhHDqEmyH0GKKY89ihZR2J48AWUoFiqW2qU4FpIKM1ja7YtF_q5KLiQWWIka_Q/w640-h402/%25E5%2596%2580%25E5%2599%25A0%25E5%2596%2580%25E5%2599%25A0%25E5%2596%2580%25E5%2599%25A0.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span><p></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">作品名稱</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">繪本《喀噠喀噠喀噠》內頁</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">作品簡介</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">「Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h」上gâu，伊是阿媽ê大tshit-thô-mi̍h，總--是順利完成查某囡仔嬰天馬行空ê願望。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Tsit一擺，重要任務tsiah進行到一半，「khah-khah、ta̍h-ta̍h、khah-ta̍h......khah khah khah khah......」，害--ah，「Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h」歹--去--ah！M̄-koh任務iáu是及時完成--ah。是按怎達成--ê？Kám講有啥mi̍h比「Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h」koh-khah gâu？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">「Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h Khah-ta̍h」ê聲音，kā規家伙ê感情thīnn kah bā-bā-bā，就ná像阿媽hām查某囡仔嬰之間ê愛，永遠bē煞。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">出版</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">步步出版</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">https://www.facebook.com/pacebooks.repbook</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">作者簡介</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">林小杯，繪本創作者，「Ē liàn-tńg台文讀寫班」結業學員。</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjpd_7OCNTeLIJOnxaKrU7xx7f0DWA_8zR4YkfOhSpEnbiC9C9uGK3kS7GlDksD629LbHhQdwcEddzpdCSkCwHeEANATbOF4vy1XZN2TEjzj1cMDtCvrHxrlmttdYvi1uXFp9eNL-nzmUg0/s1424/322%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjpd_7OCNTeLIJOnxaKrU7xx7f0DWA_8zR4YkfOhSpEnbiC9C9uGK3kS7GlDksD629LbHhQdwcEddzpdCSkCwHeEANATbOF4vy1XZN2TEjzj1cMDtCvrHxrlmttdYvi1uXFp9eNL-nzmUg0/s320/322%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" /></span></a></div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: 15px;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></b></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_J